{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a splashing good time in Smoots Crazy Wave! This fast-paced arcade racer brings the beloved Smoots characters to thrilling water tracks where you\u2019ll compete for victory. Whether you prefer classic Slalom races, powerup-filled mayhem, or intense Battle Royale showdowns, there's a mode for every type of racer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844020/extras/68522848e296b8ac2abf988df1b598ba.poster.avif?t=1756379663\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844020/extras/68522848e296b8ac2abf988df1b598ba.webm?t=1756379663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844020/extras/68522848e296b8ac2abf988df1b598ba.mp4?t=1756379663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across vibrant locations like Honu Island, Iceland, and the mysterious Lost World, using skill and strategy to outpace your rivals. And if you\u2019re falling behind, grab a powerup to turn the tide! Play solo or challenge up to 3 friends in local multiplayer to prove who rules the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844020/extras/25582a110a5e06d5bf90aa99ecf4fa33.poster.avif?t=1756379663\" width=650 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844020/extras/25582a110a5e06d5bf90aa99ecf4fa33.webm?t=1756379663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844020/extras/25582a110a5e06d5bf90aa99ecf4fa33.mp4?t=1756379663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer: Up to 4 players can race together in split-screen mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting game modes: Choose from Slalom, Battle Royale, Time Trial, Exhibition, and practice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 unique Smoots: Each character has their own stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful tracks: Race across exotic locations, from tropical beaches to icy landscapes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to ride the waves?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Iceland Whales","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844020/9481f45e60aa46af3bda83db93d4ccbd3e97eb92.jpg"},{"name":"Japan Building","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844020/851fe763bc144fecfff91aa342d671248e2c33e4.jpg"},{"name":"Japan Ship","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844020/1f27f2609d76d1a51b972be0965d6c020c6f0596.jpg"},{"name":"Kaneda Bike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844020/3acb4e5d43bfb5bf4dc3763a5cb8bd95943a97bf.jpg"},{"name":"Sea of Smoots Barrel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844020/48757fbdda862e9faea66532e49463664825c591.jpg"},{"name":"Turbo Shark Power Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844020/0a52b84ac9e88f2b6188afc7a0559b6ea4dd878a.jpg"},{"name":"Honu Island Card","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844020/80eaf30971ef3d73a6ce67058b2b7ba48948262f.jpg"},{"name":"Sea Of Smoots Card","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844020/b599c40d87ddcbafd0b2ad24bd8ff9e83e23666c.jpg"},{"name":"Iceland Card","path":"https://cd